From 634b769391459a1c76f4f68c85ab65d0bed66db9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: build <build@localhost>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 15:53:45 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 07/11] sdl1: display settings menu (Alt+F9)

A full-screen menu for the Apple II PC boot image: screen resolution,
scaling (aspect or sharp) and monitor shape. It edits the display.txt
named by APPLE2PC_DISPLAY_FILE (keeping its comments and line ends) and
Scale Mode / Monitor Aspect in linapple.conf, refits the picture at once,
and when the resolution changed asks whether to restart: yes creates the
file named by APPLE2PC_REBOOT_FLAG and quits so the session restarts the
machine. Without APPLE2PC_DISPLAY_FILE it only shows a short message.
